Source of the files
  arthas-packaging-4.3.5-bin.zip from Maven Central:
  https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/com/taobao/arthas/arthas-packaging/4.3.5/
  SHA-256 of the archive:
  2f75ea954ead5d02c4a743ecd783fd92f546a44ef3aee437ea5066eb30ad07bf
  The archive contains no LICENSE or NOTICE file. The file LICENSE and the
  notices below are the files LICENSE and NOTICE of the Arthas 4.3.5 source
  tree. LICENSE is identical to META-INF/FastDoubleParser-LICENSE inside
  arthas-core.jar.

Changes made by the allowops project
  arthas.properties: the lines for arthas.mcpEndpoint and arthas.mcpProtocol
  are removed, so that the MCP server of Arthas does not start. No other line
  is changed.
  arthas-agent.jar, arthas-core.jar, arthas-spy.jar and logback.xml are
  unmodified.

Not included from the archive
  arthas-boot.jar, arthas-client.jar, math-game.jar, as.sh, as.bat,
  as-service.bat, install-local.sh, the async-profiler directory and the lib
  directory.

Third-party components
  arthas-core.jar contains third-party components under their own licenses.
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES lists them, states the license that applies to each,
  carries the notices that the jar carries, and gives the text of the Eclipse
  Public License 1.0 and the location of the source code for logback.

Verification
  SHA256SUMS lists the SHA-256 of every other file in this directory:
  sha256sum --check SHA256SUMS

